<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Cimpor '96 results March 26.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Cimpor '96 results March 26.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese cement company Cimpor-Cimentos de Portugal said it would announce its 1996 results at a news conference at 1200 GMT on March 26.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
